### =====================================================================
### Topic 4 requests. In VS Code install the "REST Client" extension,
### then click "Send Request" above any request below.
### =====================================================================

### --- Example 2 (port 8042) ---------------------------------------------
GET http://localhost:8042/hello?name=Ada

###
GET http://localhost:8042/students/1

###
POST http://localhost:8042/echo
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Chioma", "age": 17 }


### --- Project: Homework Tracker (port 8084) ------------------------------

### List all homework
GET http://localhost:8084/homework

### Filter by subject (@RequestParam)
GET http://localhost:8084/homework?subject=Maths

### Get one (@PathVariable)
GET http://localhost:8084/homework/1

### Get one that does NOT exist -> 404 from GlobalErrorHandler
GET http://localhost:8084/homework/99

### Create (@RequestBody) -> 201 Created
POST http://localhost:8084/homework
Content-Type: application/json

{ "subject": "Physics", "description": "Read chapter 3 on motion" }

### Create with an empty subject -> 400 Bad Request
POST http://localhost:8084/homework
Content-Type: application/json

{ "subject": "", "description": "This should fail" }

### Mark as done
PUT http://localhost:8084/homework/1/done

### Delete -> 204 No Content
DELETE http://localhost:8084/homework/2
